body=f'''<h2>Planned vs. trending: the side-by-side</h2><table><tr><th>#</th><th>Adults plan to wear (NRF)</th><th>Kids plan to wear (NRF)</th><th>Top trending searches (Google Frightgeist)</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>Witch (4.8M people)</td><td>Spider-Man (4.6M kids)</td><td>Buddy the Unicorn</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Vampire (4.2M)</td><td>Superhero (2.3M)</td><td>NeeDoh</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Batman (2M)</td><td>Princess (2.2M)</td><td>Nikki (Obsession)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Spider-Man (1.5M)</td><td>Witch (1.6M)</td><td>Agamemnon (The Odyssey)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Ghost (1.4M)</td><td>Ghost (1.6M)</td><td>Lily Love Braids (Poppy Playtime)</td></tr></table>
<p class="src">NRF figures are from its survey of 7,889 consumers, Sept 1 to 9, 2026. Frightgeist ranks searches that are rising, not total popularity.</p>
<h2>What the two lists tell you</h2><p>If you want to blend in at the party, go NRF: witch, vampire, a superhero. If you want the "oh my gosh, I love that" reaction, go Frightgeist. The rest of Google's top 10 is Oliver Tree, Verity from Minecraft, Carl from Dungeon Crawler Carl, Disco Scooby-Doo and Hazel Hook from Descendants. Dolly Parton, who died in August, tops Google's kids list and is No. 2 for pets, and Michael Jackson's Thriller look is at a 10-year search high.</p>
<h2>The pet report</h2><p>NRF says the pumpkin (11.6%) and the hot dog (5.9%) are still the top pet costumes, with ghosts, bats and spiders climbing. Google's trending pet searches are pure chaos: a centipede, Dolly Parton, Bullseye from Toy Story and, yes, a can of Diet Coke.</p>
<h2>Shopping tips</h2><p>NRF says discount stores are the top place people shop for Halloween, followed by costume shops and online. The closer you get to the 31st, the thinner the racks, so the popular kids' sizes go first. Trick-or-treat hours are set locally, so check your town's announcement.</p>
<h2>Keep the spooky going</h2><ul><li><a href="{R2}blog/halloween-costume-trends-2026/">Our explainer: why these costumes are blowing up</a></li><li><a href="{R2}tv-streaming/crystal-lake-peacock/">Crystal Lake: the Friday the 13th prequel to binge</a></li><li><a href="{R2}home/">The 12-foot Skelly and home decor trends</a></li><li><a href="{R2}pets/cats/">Cats, the internet's favorite costume models</a></li><li><a href="{R2}memes-viral/tiktok-dances/">TikTok dances and costume walks</a></li><li><a href="../">More pop culture</a></li></ul>'''+follow("HalloweenCostume"),
