body=f'''<h2>Why it's everywhere</h2><p>It's a glossy synth-pop independence anthem built for a chant-along, and fans are clipping the money line all over X and TikTok. A big televised performance three days after release is perfect timing, so expect the song to climb this week.</p>
<h2>Tonight's lineup</h2><p>McRae shares the VS stage with KATSEYE, Megan Moroney and Megan Thee Stallion. Our <a href="{R2}fashion-beauty/victorias-secret-fashion-show-2026/">VS Fashion Show guide</a> has the stream links, and the <a href="{R2}blog/victorias-secret-fashion-show-2026-guide/">full viewing guide</a> covers who's walking.</p>
<h2>More music</h2><ul><li><a href="../charts/">What's topping the Hot 100</a></li><li><a href="../expectations-remix-rodrigo-roan/">Olivia Rodrigo x Chappell Roan "expectations"</a></li><li><a href="../tiktok-sounds/">TikTok sounds</a></li></ul>'''+follow("TateMcRae"),
